{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Dotica 是一款像素藝術相機與相片編輯器，可把普通相片轉換成復古像素風格，適合製作社交媒體內容、復古插畫、lo-fi 視覺效果或日常實驗創作。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-27.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>復古像素藝術即時預覽</h2>\n<p>Dotica 提供經典抖色演算法，包括 Floyd-Steinberg、Bayer 與 Atkinson，並可選用預設或自訂調色盤。調整亮度、對比度、中間調、明度與光暈時，畫面會即時預覽，方便塑造 8-bit 復古質感。完成後可輸出高解析度作品至相片圖庫，亦可分享至常用平台。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-30-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-31-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Pixel Art Photo Editor: Dotica</li><li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pixel-art-photo-editor-dotica/id6811392303?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:11.785468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:18:54.382505+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:13.774646+00:00","content_hash":"878701c22552cf9e151eedc0195935e82ed4a06b7689f4799c712c1b233611f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}